  "title": "Free! Eternal Summer",
  "justification": "AniDB specials S2-S4 \"Slideshow 1-3 / Kansha Tokuten\" had no row and fell on TVDB season 0 episodes 2-4, the FrFr! shorts of AniDB 9858. TVDB lists no slideshow, so they are unmapped. S1 \"Forbidden All-Hard!\" stays on season 0 episode 8 of the same title. TMDB 61456 season 0 E8 Free! Eternal Summer: Forbidden All Hard! (2015-03-18) is AniDB 10415's special S1 Kindan no All Hard! (2015-03-18), the same episode as TVDB 0x8 (row ;1-8;). S2 to S4 (Kansha Tokuten 1 to 3, slideshows with no air date) are on neither site; left unmapped they default onto 0x2 to 0x4 and S0E2 to S0E4, which are the FrFr! short movies of AniDB 9858. Anime-Lists names only tvdbseason in the row, so TMDB took the default S0E1 for S1. The rows pair S1 with 0x8 and S0E8 and send S2 to S4 to no episode.",
